scenario: the raylib spiral renders through a software OpenGL driver
requires: network, display, opengl, env WITH_UAT_OPENGL32_DLL
platforms: windows

new directory
run: with init .
run: with get c.raylib
write src/main.w from raylib_spiral_main.w
copy $WITH_UAT_OPENGL32_DLL to out/bin/opengl32.dll
run: with check src/main.w
expect stdout: ok
run: with run
expect exit: 0
expect stdout contains: raylib spiral UAT passed:
expect (human): colored balls moving on a field of black
